#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:non_profit_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"1. <strong>Launch the Campaign</strong>: Create a Project called <em>Stop "
"Child\n"
"                Labor</em> and add key tasks like “Create awareness "
"materials” and “Reach out to\n"
"            schools and local authorities”."
msgstr ""
"1. <strong>ເປີດຕົວແຄມເປນ</strong>: ສ້າງໂຄງການທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ <em>ຢຸດຕິແຮງງານເດັກ</em>\n"
"                ແລະ ເພີ່ມໜ້າວຽກຫຼັກ ເຊັ່ນ “ສ້າງສື່ປູກຈິດສຳນຶກ” ແລະ “ປະສານງານຫາ\n"
"            ໂຮງຮຽນ ແລະ ອຳນາດການປົກຄອງທ້ອງຖິ່ນ”."

#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:non_profit_organization.view_page_home
msgid "10 <span class=\"s_donation_currency ps-1\">€</span>"
msgstr "10 <span class=\"s_donation_currency ps-1\">€</span>"

#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:non_profit_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"2. <strong>Publish Donation &amp; Petition Forms</strong>: Use the Website "
"to embed a\n"
"            donation form and a petition urging policy changes."
msgstr ""
"2. <strong>ເຜີຍແຜ່ແບບຟອມບໍລິຈາກ &amp; ຄຳຮ້ອງຮຽກຮ້ອງ</strong>: "
"ນຳໃຊ້ເວັບໄຊສ໌ເພື່ອຝັງແບບຟອມ\n"
"            ບໍລິຈາກ ແລະ ຄຳຮ້ອງຮຽກຮ້ອງເພື່ອຊຸກຍູ້ການປ່ຽນແປງນະໂຍບາຍ."

#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model:event.event,name:non_profit_organization.event_event_4
msgid "2025 Annual General Assembly"
msgstr "ກອງປະຊຸມໃຫຍ່ປະຈຳປີ 2025"

#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:non_profit_organization.view_page_home
msgid "25 <span class=\"s_donation_currency ps-1\">€</span>"
msgstr "25 <span class=\"s_donation_currency ps-1\">€</span>"

#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:non_profit_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"3. <strong>Organize Awareness Events</strong>: Schedule events like "
"<em>Community\n"
"                Talks</em> or <em>Film Screenings</em> using Events."
msgstr ""
"3. <strong>ຈັດງານສ້າງຈິດສຳນຶກ</strong>: ກຳນົດຕາຕະລາງງານ ເຊັ່ນ <em>ເວທີສົນທະນາຊຸມຊົນ</"
"em>\n"
"                ຫຼື <em>ການສາຍຮູບເງົາ</em> ໂດຍນຳໃຊ້ Events."

#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:non_profit_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"4. <strong>Involve Volunteers</strong>: Create volunteer roles in Employees "
"and assign\n"
"            shifts using Planning."
msgstr ""
"4. <strong>ດຶງດູດອາສາສະໝັກເຂົ້າຮ່ວມ</strong>: ສ້າງບົດບາດອາສາສະໝັກໃນ Employees ແລະ "
"ມອບໝາຍ\n"
"            ຜຽນເຮັດວຽກໂດຍນຳໃຊ້ Planning."

#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:non_profit_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"5.<strong> Sell Campaign Merchandise</strong>: Offer items like a <em>“Stop "
"Child\n"
"                Labor” badge</em> via eCommerce, and manage orders and "
"payments online."
msgstr ""
"5. <strong>ຂາຍສິນຄ້າທີ່ລະນຶກຂອງແຄມເປນ</strong>: ຂາຍສິນຄ້າ ເຊັ່ນ <em>ເຂັມຂັດ "
"“ຢຸດຕິແຮງງານເດັກ”</em>\n"
"                ຜ່ານ eCommerce, ແລະ ຈັດການລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ ພ້ອມທັງການຊຳລະເງິນທາງອອນລາຍ."

#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:non_profit_organization.view_page_home
msgid "50 <span class=\"s_donation_currency ps-1\">€</span>"
msgstr "50 <span class=\"s_donation_currency ps-1\">€</span>"

#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:non_profit_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"6. <strong>Track Costs</strong>: Log campaign-related expenses in Expenses, "
"linked to the\n"
"            project."
msgstr ""
"6. <strong>ຕິດຕາມລາຍຈ່າຍ</strong>: ບັນທຶກລາຍຈ່າຍທີ່ຕິດພັນກັບແຄມເປນໃນ Expenses, "
"ເຊິ່ງເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບ\n"
"            ໂຄງການ."

#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:non_profit_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"7. <strong>Receive Donation</strong>: Receive donations straight from your "
"Website."
msgstr "7. <strong>ຮັບການບໍລິຈາກ</strong>: ຮັບເງິນບໍລິຈາກໂດຍກົງຈາກເວັບໄຊສ໌ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:non_profit_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"8. <strong>Send Attestations</strong>: Generate and send donation receipt at "
"the end of the year."
msgstr "8. <strong>ສົ່ງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ</strong>: ສ້າງ ແລະ ສົ່ງໃບຮັບເງິນບໍລິຈາກໃນທ້າຍປີ."

#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:non_profit_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"9. <strong>Keep Supporters Engaged</strong>: Use Email Marketing to send "
"updates and\n"
"            thank-you messages to donors and petition signers."
msgstr ""
"9. <strong>ຮັກສາການພົວພັນກັບຜູ້ສະໜັບສະໜູນ</strong>: ນຳໃຊ້ Email Marketing "
"ເພື່ອສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນອັບເດດ ແລະ\n"
"            ຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອບໃຈເຖິງຜູ້ບໍລິຈາກ ແລະ ຜູ້ລົງລາຍເຊັນໃນຄຳຮ້ອງຮຽກຮ້ອງ."

