"ສ້າງຜົນກະທົບທີ່ດີຍິ່ງຂຶ້ນ."

#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:non_profit_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Thank-you notes for donors, petition follow-ups, and newsletters are sent "
"using <strong>\n"
